Dialogue: 3,0:02:26.02,0:02:30.02,title,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,825)\bord0\blur0.75\clip(0,825,1920,828)\c&HCEA616&}Illusionary Avenger
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.15,0:02:34.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.63,0:02:35.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's your problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.55,0:02:40.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, what happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.59,0:02:42.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I lost him.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.13,0:02:44.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He Teleport off somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.37,0:02:48.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The system's supposed to\Nprotect players inside the inns.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.07,0:02:51.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought if anywhere,\Nshe'd be safe in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.97,0:02:53.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.39,0:02:57.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That robe was Griselda's.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.11,0:03:01.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was Griselda's ghost.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.21,0:03:04.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's come back to get revenge on us.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.79,0:03:07.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.35,0:03:09.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Only a ghost can PK\Nsomeone in a safe zone.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.77,0:03:13.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That wasn't a ghost.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.15,0:03:17.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Someone's using the system to kill.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.29,0:03:20.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the only way these murders\Ncould have happened in a safe zone.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.63,0:03:21.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.59,0:03:28.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know what to think.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.47,0:03:31.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Was that black-robed\Nfigure Griselda's ghost?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.03,0:03:36.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After seeing two people die mysteriously,\NI'm starting to think it's possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.47,0:03:38.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.38,0:03:40.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That definitely wasn't a ghost.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.27,0:03:42.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd bet my life on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.83,0:03:45.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why would a ghost need a teleport crystal?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.23,0:03:48.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Teleport crystal. What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.05,0:03:51.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nah, it's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.81,0:04:02.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.91,0:04:05.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is that for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.77,0:04:07.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, what do you think I'm doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.57,0:04:08.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Showing it off?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.48,0:04:10.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you going to take it or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.59,0:04:12.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, thanks. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.03,0:04:16.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Better eat it fast before it disappears.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.45,0:04:18.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Its durability is almost down to zero.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.25,0:04:20.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, uh, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.97,0:04:26.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.63,0:04:31.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When the heck do you find\Ntime to pick this up?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.07,0:04:34.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I had a feeling we wouldn't\Nhave time for lunch today.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.99,0:04:36.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So this morning I packed one for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.01,0:04:38.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurry up and eat it, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.27,0:04:40.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gotta hand it to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.65,0:04:43.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For a second in command of the\NKnights of the Blood Oath, You rock.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.61,0:04:45.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where'd you buy these, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.37,0:04:47.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.19,0:04:49.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I made it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.83,0:04:51.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, I can cook, so what?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.25,0:04:56.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.33,0:04:58.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't even know what to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.09,0:05:02.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, if you're looking for a second\Ncareer, you'd make a killing selling these.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.29,0:05:10.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, should've been eating\Ninstead of talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.53,0:05:16.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you crying?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.33,0:05:20.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.11,0:05:22.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.31,0:05:23.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.99,0:05:24.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.15,0:05:26.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What did you just figure out?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.47,0:05:28.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.38,0:05:29.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.73,0:05:31.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We never saw a thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.75,0:05:35.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We just thought we did, but\Nwe were seeing something else.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.63,0:05:36.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.41,0:05:40.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The game doesn't allow\Nkilling inside a safe zone.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.67,0:05:42.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no weapon or system exploit.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:45.76,0:05:49.26,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\pos(961.5,945)\fad(479,0)\fsp-1.5\fscy85\xshad1.5\yshad3\c&H121212&\4c&H150F0D&\blur3\fs72\alpha&H40\3c&H091E1C&\fscx100}19{\fscx95}th Floor • Hill of the Cross
Dialogue: 1,0:05:45.76,0:05:49.26,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\pos(961.5,945)\fad(479,0)\fsp-1.5\fscy85\xshad1.5\yshad3\c&H121212&\4c&H150F0D&\blur3\fs72\alpha&H30\fscx100}19{\fscx95}th Floor • Hill of the Cross
Dialogue: 2,0:05:45.76,0:05:49.26,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,942)\fad(479,0)\fsp-1.5\fscy85\shad0\blur0.45\fs72\c&HF5F5F5&\fscx100}19{\fscx95}th Floor • Hill of the Cross
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.87,0:05:48.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Griselda
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.83,0:05:51.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The only way I can be saved now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.95,0:05:53.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is if you forgive me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.89,0:05:55.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.85,0:05:57.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.17,0:05:58.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please forgive me, Griselda.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.99,0:06:00.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I swear.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.43,0:06:02.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I never thought this was going to happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.55,0:06:03.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have to believe me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.53,0:06:08.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh really!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.01,0:06:36.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What did you do to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.03,0:06:38.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me, Schmidt.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.17,0:06:40.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me what you did.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.01,0:06:42.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.39,0:06:45.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.59,0:06:47.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The day we voted to sell the ring,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.15,0:06:51.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I looked at my belt pouch and there was\Na crystal and a note with instructions.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.93,0:06:53.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who were they from?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.67,0:06:56.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who gave you them?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.89,0:07:02.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Grimlock, you're dead too?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.03,0:07:04.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.25,0:07:08.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to know who gave\Nyou those instructions.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.35,0:07:09.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.33,0:07:10.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I swear I don't know!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.99,0:07:14.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The note said for me to bind\Nthe crystal to Grisolda's room
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.47,0:07:17.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,at the inn she was staying at\Nso whoever it was could get in.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.65,0:07:20.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then I had to put the crystal\Nin the guild's shared storage.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.93,0:07:21.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then what?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.71,0:07:24.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's all I did! I swear!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.37,0:07:26.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't want her to die!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.01,0:07:28.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't want to be part of that!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.11,0:07:29.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.02,0:07:30.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Believe me!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.97,0:07:40.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We recorded everything you said, Schmidt.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.67,0:07:52.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, they're alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.87,0:07:54.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yup, they're alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.85,0:07:56.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Both Caynz and Yolko.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.69,0:08:02.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Inside safe zones, a player's\NHP doesn't deplete on its own.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.31,0:08:04.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But the durability of an object does.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.75,0:08:06.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just like that sandwich you gave me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.81,0:08:07.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.33,0:08:11.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That day, the spear was\Nsticking out of Kynes' armor.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.03,0:08:14.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It wasn't draining his HP, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.27,0:08:16.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was draining the\Ndurability of his armor.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.33,0:08:22.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But then, his body didn't disintegrate.\NIt was… Yup. Just his armor. Nothing else.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.17,0:08:27.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And at the precise second when his\Narmor's durability expired, poof.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.69,0:08:30.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Caynz used a crystal to\Nteleport out of his armor.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.77,0:08:35.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure, it looks a lot like what happens\Nwhen a player dies in the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.17,0:08:37.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Only he didn't die.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.69,0:08:41.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then what happened to Yorkel?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.61,0:08:44.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I bet the dagger was rigged\Nto her back the whole time.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.45,0:08:46.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She had it all planned out.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.35,0:08:47.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But we would have seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.65,0:08:49.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Only if she turned around, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.63,0:08:52.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Remember, she never turned her back to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.23,0:08:53.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not even once.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.91,0:08:57.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She kept an eye on her equipment's\Ndurability level while she was talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.79,0:08:59.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When it got down to zero,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.49,0:09:02.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,all she had to do was act\Nlike she was hit by a dagger,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.51,0:09:04.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,thrown from outside the window.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.21,0:09:07.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who was the person in the\Nblack robe you chased?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.95,0:09:10.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It wasn't Grimlock, I'm\Npretty sure of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.55,0:09:11.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But Caynz?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.95,0:09:13.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He and Yoriko were in it together.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.29,0:09:18.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They figured out how they could use\Nthis method to fake their own deaths.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.25,0:09:22.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Getting people to think they were murdered\Nin a safe zone was a calculated twist.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.63,0:09:24.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everything they did was\Ndesigned to draw out the
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.87,0:09:28.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,person behind Griselda's\Nmurder and expose him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.57,0:09:30.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The only way to find out\Nfor sure was by faking
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.01,0:09:33.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,their deaths and creating\Nan illusionary Avenger.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.43,0:09:38.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And Schmidt was the person they had picked\Nfor it, probably since the beginning.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.37,0:09:41.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, you still have Yolko on\Nyour friend list, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.91,0:09:48.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right now she's in the field on floor 19.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.55,0:09:52.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It looks like she's on a small\Nhill, just outside of town. I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.71,0:09:55.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's it then.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.83,0:09:57.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess they can handle it from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.83,0:10:01.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, our job's pretty much\Ndone now, wouldn't you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.19,0:10:03.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.35,0:10:10.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You were recording?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.81,0:10:16.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, that's how it is, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.49,0:10:20.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You cared about what happened\Nto Griselda after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.79,0:10:24.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course we did, but you didn't betray\Nher because you hated her, did you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.01,0:10:27.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I didn't hate her, honest.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.65,0:10:28.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.61,0:10:31.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,sure, I feel guilty getting\Nmoney for my part of it,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.43,0:10:34.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but the rare weapon I bought helped\Nme get into the Holy Dragon Alliance,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.93,0:10:35.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.97,0:10:46.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Paralysis?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.67,0:10:50.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One down!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.27,0:10:56.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.75,0:11:00.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's a hell of a catch.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.11,0:11:04.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A big shot from the Holy Dragon Alliance.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.55,0:11:14.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Laughing Coffin, the Murder Guild.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.75,0:11:23.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alright, what game should\Nwe play with these three?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.27,0:11:25.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I know! I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.87,0:11:28.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's play the one where\Nthey have to kill each other
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.11,0:11:31.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,last one standing wins. I\Nknow it's your favorite,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.47,0:11:33.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but last time we did that\Nyou killed the winner anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.97,0:11:36.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, come on. You spoiled it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.17,0:11:38.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's no fun if they know they're gonna die
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.25,0:11:45.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, let's get this show on the road
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.43,0:11:57.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.13,0:12:09.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.37,0:12:13.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like I made it just in time.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.11,0:12:19.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, now what?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.95,0:12:22.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I got 30 players from\Nthe assault team coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.97,0:12:25.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You guys want to stay and fight them?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.57,0:12:43.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.17,0:13:02.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nice to see you alive again, Yolko.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.29,0:13:07.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You won't believe me, but after it was\Nover, I was going to tell you the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.97,0:13:10.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am sorry we had to\Ntrick you to help us out.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.07,0:13:16.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kirito, thank you for saving me,\Nbut how did you figure it out?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.31,0:13:19.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How did you know those\Nthree would attack us here?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.75,0:13:21.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't figure anything out.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.71,0:13:23.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was acting on a hunch is all.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.09,0:13:27.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Yolko, Caynz, level with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.47,0:13:31.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You guys asked Grimlock to make the\Nspear and the knife, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.59,0:13:35.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We did, but he was against\Nour plan from the beginning.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.23,0:13:39.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All he wanted was to let\NGriselda rest in peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.67,0:13:41.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He did forge the weapons for us,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.73,0:13:44.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but only after we got down\Non our knees and begged him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.91,0:13:48.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, but he had a different\Nreason for not liking your plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.27,0:13:50.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Griselda had nothing to do with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.85,0:13:55.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was worried faking PKs in a safe zone\Nwas going to draw a lot of attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.27,0:13:59.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He didn't want to take the risk of\Nsomeone snooping around for answers.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.37,0:14:02.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We figured the whole thing\Nout about half an hour ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.99,0:14:09.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We ended up playing right into\NYoriko's hands, didn't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.63,0:14:10.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.54,0:14:12.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't really mind. Yeah, me neither.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.27,0:14:18.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, if you were in their guild,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.23,0:14:22.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and a super rare item like that\Ndropped, what would you have done?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.99,0:14:23.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.90,0:14:24.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I play solo.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.23,0:14:28.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Part of why I do is so I can\Navoid situations like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.13,0:14:32.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In my guild, the one who\Ngot the kill gets it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.33,0:14:34.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those are the rules we have to play by.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.67,0:14:37.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know how in SAO, if\Na player gets a drop,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.17,0:14:39.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,no one knows unless\Nthat person reports it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.77,0:14:44.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our way, no one can hoard stuff because\Nwe worked out who gets what ahead of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.59,0:14:45.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Also,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.50,0:14:49.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the rules my guilt play by gives the concept\Nof marriage in this world real meaning.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.03,0:14:50.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.09,0:14:53.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you marry, you have to\Nshare your item storage.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.07,0:14:55.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you're single,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.19,0:14:57.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you can hide whatever\Nyou want, but, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.39,0:15:00.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,when you're married, you\Ncan't hide it anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.61,0:15:04.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think sharing storage with the person\Nyou're married to is wonderfully pragmatic.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.87,0:15:07.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At the same time, I think\Nit's also very romantic.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.93,0:15:12.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey. Yeah? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.19,0:15:17.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, uh, how many times have\Nyou been married, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.01,0:15:21.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, I didn't mean it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.31,0:15:22.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That didn't come out right!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.53,0:15:25.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You were talking about how it's\Nromantic and plastic and...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.35,0:15:27.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I did not say that, you ass!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.75,0:15:30.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What I said is it's\Nromantic and pragmatic.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.83,0:15:34.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For your information, the word\Npragmatic means practical. My god.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.07,0:15:38.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You think marriage in SAO\Nis practical? Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.05,0:15:40.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you're married,\Neverything's out in the open,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.07,0:15:43.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you know, because of common storage.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.19,0:15:45.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.41,0:15:47.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.32,0:15:48.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Common storage.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.83,0:15:50.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, say your spouse dies.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.93,0:15:52.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What happens to the items?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.55,0:15:55.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Item storage is shared, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.85,0:15:59.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So when one person dies,\Nwhat happens to their stuff?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.13,0:16:05.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you're talking about Griselda and\NGrimlock, hmm, if one of them died...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.33,0:16:08.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everything would go to the\Nsurviving spouse, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.17,0:16:12.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And if everything goes to the spouse,\Nthen the ring in Griselda's storage...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.05,0:16:16.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,...should be sitting in Grimlock's\Nstorage, not the killer's.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.25,0:16:18.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's been sitting there this whole time.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.25,0:16:20.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was never stolen in the first place.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.19,0:16:22.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, it was stolen.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.83,0:16:24.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter it's still there.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.79,0:16:29.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Grimlock was basically stealing it the\Nminute he put his plan into action.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.01,0:16:34.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was Grimlock?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.39,0:16:37.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then those were his instructions.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.95,0:16:39.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And he killed Griselda, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.95,0:16:42.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I doubt he was the one\Nwho actually killed her.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.25,0:16:48.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Although, I'm pretty sure he went and found\Nhimself a red player to do it for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.95,0:16:49.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My God.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.43,0:16:52.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But then if he really did have her killed,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.73,0:16:55.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,why would he go to all that\Ntrouble just to help us out?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.89,0:16:59.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You explained your plan to\Nhim in detail, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.97,0:17:03.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your plan was the perfect\Nchance for him to bury
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.37,0:17:06.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the ring incident and any\Nwitnesses once and for all.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.93,0:17:09.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All he'd have to do is\Nsit back and wait for you,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.09,0:17:12.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Schmidt, and Caynz to get together.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.13,0:17:13.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'd be sitting ducks.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.39,0:17:16.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.35,0:17:17.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's why.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.63,0:17:20.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They knew we'd be here\Nbecause he hired them.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.57,0:17:21.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.53,0:17:25.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My guess is it was probably the same\Nbunch he hired to kill Griselda.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.77,0:17:27.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh my god.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.67,0:17:31.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Found him.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.49,0:17:39.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you want to know more,\Nyou can ask the man yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.13,0:17:44.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.04,0:17:46.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Long time no see, comrades.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.09,0:17:48.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.55,0:17:50.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.57,0:17:52.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,did you really plan this?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.25,0:17:56.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How could you, Grimlock? Answer me!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.83,0:17:58.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why did you kill Griselda?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.53,0:17:59.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Was it the money?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.63,0:18:03.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Was the money so important to you\Nthat you'd kill your own wife for it?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.15,0:18:05.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Money?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.59,0:18:07.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you say money?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.89,0:18:15.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It wasn't for the money.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.87,0:18:16.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I had to.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.07,0:18:20.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No matter what, I had to kill her\Nwhile we were stuck in this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.51,0:18:23.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I had to kill her while\Nshe was still my wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.41,0:18:27.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And because she was also\Nmy wife in the real world.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.41,0:18:32.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In a way, she was the perfect wife. Ideal.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.63,0:18:34.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So pretty, so submissive.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.13,0:18:38.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The whole time we were together,\Nwe never had a single fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.51,0:18:43.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But when we were trapped in\Nhere, in this world, she changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.53,0:18:50.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In here, I was the one who was afraid,\Nterrified of playing this death game.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.97,0:18:56.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But she looked so much happier here, more\Nalive than she ever did in the real world.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.77,0:19:00.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There was nothing I could do about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.17,0:19:01.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.49,0:19:03.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Yuuki I loved was gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.97,0:19:09.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gone but then I realized I didn't\Nhave to live with the way she was.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.61,0:19:11.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Murder is part of this game.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.31,0:19:15.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I couldn't have the Yuuki I loved\Nback, I'd settle for the memory of her.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.17,0:19:16.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And who could blame me?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.69,0:19:19.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's why you did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.51,0:19:21.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the reason you killed your wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.55,0:19:22.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's reason enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.01,0:19:26.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And someday you'll understand too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.15,0:19:29.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once you've found love, believe me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.41,0:19:31.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll do anything to keep it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.73,0:19:34.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're wrong, Grimlock!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.29,0:19:36.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've got it all wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.33,0:19:38.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You didn't love Griselda.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.67,0:19:40.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's not what you felt.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.27,0:19:43.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You stopped loving her when you\Nbecame selfish and possessive.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.83,0:19:59.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kirito, we appreciate your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.33,0:20:01.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I think this is our\Nproblem to deal with now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.75,0:20:02.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.99,0:20:21.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.59,0:20:25.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Say it was you, and you married someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.33,0:20:29.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And later on, you found out she had\Na side tour you didn't know about.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.53,0:20:31.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How would you feel?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.11,0:20:36.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess that I was lucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.25,0:20:39.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.16,0:20:40.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, if you marry someone,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.91,0:20:43.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that means you already like whatever\Nyou know about them, doesn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.65,0:20:45.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And if you discovered\Nsomething you didn't know
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.63,0:20:47.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,about them before and fell\Nin love with that too,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.71,0:20:49.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then that would be awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.11,0:20:52.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right, good answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.99,0:20:54.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyway, I'm hungry after all this.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.33,0:20:57.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't really get to finish my dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.53,0:20:59.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah, he didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.95,0:21:02.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We should get back to work tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.23,0:21:04.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've been off the front\Nlines for two days.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.59,0:21:09.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I was hoping to have this floor\Ntotally cleared by the end of this week.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.87,0:21:11.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now what?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.09,0:21:46.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Kirito.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.33,0:21:47.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you want to friend me?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.19,0:21:50.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's kind of silly not to.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.27,0:21:52.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's convenient.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.53,0:21:54.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We are in the same assault team after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.67,0:21:56.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I'm a solo player.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.25,0:21:59.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, I didn't say you had\Nto form a party with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.83,0:22:02.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You should try to make some\Nfriends while you're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.17,0:22:03.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.25,0:22:04.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not that I don't want...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.43,0:22:05.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.34,0:22:06.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Think about it while we eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.49,0:22:07.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No pressure.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.71,0:22:10.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's go back and\Nfind a good restaurant.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.29,0:22:11.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, okay.
